  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Miss The Mississippi And You**: back after 85 archived shows (772 days); rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Wharf Rat**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Shenendoah Breakdown**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **The Cuckoo**: back after 86 archived shows (773 days) [2]\n- **Shout Little Lulie**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Soon Forget**: back after 180 archived shows (1150 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Bound To Ride**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Sitting Here In Limbo**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-04-10** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 150 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-04-10**: taped by Rob O'Brien; transferred by Rob O'Brien; source: MBHO KA500 (DINa) > 603 MBP > Sound Devices MixPre-6 MKII(24/96) [1]. Also: Final step was encoding with TLH at level 8, following the CD Wave tracking [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Santa Barbara Bowl - Santa Barbara, CA - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/santa-barbara-bowl-santa-barbara-ca/) [3]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Santa Barbara Bowl - Santa Barbara, CA - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/santa-barbara-bowl-santa-barbara-ca/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Santa Barbara Bowl - Santa Barbara, CA - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/santa-barbara-bowl-santa-barbara-ca/) [5]",
